      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I just realized we never implemented \"rkp-vm\" \n\nI also just realized that this value is not used anywhere...\n\nI checked that the test `VtsHalRemotelyProvisionedComponentTargetTest` passes without any issue. Mostly because the certificate type is not checked [1]. Are there any other RKP tests I should check?\n\nOtherwise, would you mind if I check in [1] that if it\u0027s avf then the value should be \"rkp-vm\"? Since the AVF HAL is purely android provided, we can enforce the value.\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:hardware/interfaces/security/keymint/support/remote_prov_utils.cpp;l\u003d923;drc\u003de2346b7a13e3d04291a05763d9ba28e5d19180a9",
